{0 API documentation}

These modules generate the reference documentation of a Catala module (the
[catala doc] command). The documented interface is made of the declarations
found in the [catala-metadata] blocks of the module, along with their
docstrings ([## ...] lines, or [#[doc = "..."]] attributes). The rest of the
file, law text included, is ignored.

{!Api_doc.Extract} reads the interface from the {{:surface.html} surface
representation} and resolves the named types it uses with the name resolution
context of {!Desugared.Name_resolution}, so that they can be linked.
{!Api_doc.Html} renders the result as a standalone HTML page.

Related modules:

{!modules: Api_doc.Extract Api_doc.Html}
